  <Title>Interviews with Abstract Artists: The Unseen Line</Title>
  <ProjectDescription>[[en]]A documentation project recording abstract artists talking about work that, they insist, is not about anything. Interviews took place in studios, galleries, one disused swimming pool and a lift that was stuck between floors. The artists speak Kürbinian, Edolo, Tok Pisin and several languages they describe as &quot;still being invented&quot;.
Generated by sample-data-generator/torture; OtherDocuments/torture-cases.md says what each folder is for.[[es]]Entrevistas con artistas abstractos: la línea invisible</ProjectDescription>
